@startuml otcp_sequence_search
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 100
actor User
participant AppShell as Shell
participant SearchIndex as Index
participant CardCatalog as Catalog
User -> Shell : type query
Shell -> Index : lookup(query)
Index --> Shell : card ids (< 100 ms target)
Shell -> Catalog : resolve rows
Catalog --> Shell : name, ban badge, art path
Shell --> User : result list
note right of Index : Index already in memory\n(QS-01)
@enduml
